tners now if uh imran  khan  wants an election at the national level  he'll have to dissolve his gov his own  government in uh two provinces and i  don't think he has the stomach to do  that right now  certainly interesting times for pakistan  we'll of course keep a very close eye on  what's happening ibrahim joining us from  karachi thank you  thank you
 

